-- DESCRIBE JAVASCRIPT ACTION
-- Verifies the describe output format (read-only, no write applied).
--
-- A `create or modify javascript action` example can't run standalone here:
-- the action must already exist in BSON (Mendix Studio Pro creates the unit
-- and its parameter/return BSON; mxcli updates Platform + the JS source file).
describe javascript action FeedbackModule.JS_isStrictMode;
